There are a few instances where we are doing something like:

int x = Integer.valueOf(string);

However this results in some unnecessary autoboxing, as it's equivalent to:

int x = new Integer(Integer.parseInt(string));

Experiment to see if good equals, hashCode, and structuralValue improves Query10 performance regression.

